--
--
`[start for _ in range(N)]` (a bound that is not a conversion-time constant
inside a function) fills every slot with the local's value. The element's
own checks (the unbound-local obligation of the Name) made the fill bail out
to nondet elements; they are now kept, guarded by a non-empty range.
